# NOTICE

This repository ("buildkit") is a reproducibility tool for rebuilding a
LineageOS 23.2 (Android 16) firmware image with Droidspaces-compatible kernel
support for the Realme GT Master Edition (lunaa / RE54ABL1 / RMX3360).

It contains:

- A frozen repo manifest (`manifests/frozen-20260825.xml`) that pins the exact
  revision of every upstream git project used for the 2026-08-25 build.
- Per-project patches (`patches/`) and kernel overlay files (`overlays/`) that
  capture only the local modifications applied on top of those pinned
  revisions. These were produced by splitting the archived
  `droidspaces-final-tracked-20260825.diff` and the allow-listed contents of
  `droidspaces-full-preflight-kernel-untracked.tar.gz`.
- Stage scripts (`scripts/`) that reproduce the build in a fresh source tree.

