## What this repository is NOT

- It does not contain a full copy of the AOSP/LineageOS source tree.
- It does not contain Droidspaces userspace, application, or Magisk module
  code; only the kernel-side kABI/config changes are captured.
- It does not contain private release signing keys. Do not commit any keys.
- The produced firmware is `userdebug`/`test-keys`; independent AVB
  cryptographic verification was not completed in the original run and remains
  an explicit, documented gap.

For details see `README.md` and the documents under `docs/`.
